@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "I'm Looking for Better Health";
}

<section class="gw-life-hero gw-health-hero">
    <div class="gw-life-hero-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="gw-life-hero-content">
            <p class="gw-eyebrow">
                A path toward better health
            </p>

            <h1>
                I’m looking for
                <span>better health.</span>
            </h1>

            <p class="gw-life-question">
                When was the last time you truly felt your best?
            </p>

            <p class="gw-life-lead">
                Maybe it has been months. Maybe it has been years. Or perhaps
                you simply know that something in your life could feel better.
            </p>

            <p class="gw-life-welcome">
                Wherever you are beginning, you are welcome here.
            </p>

            <a class="gw-button gw-button-primary"
               href="#health-welcome">
                Begin Exploring
                <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


<section id="health-welcome" class="gw-health-welcome">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="gw-health-welcome-grid">
            <div class="gw-health-welcome-heading">
                <p class="gw-eyebrow gw-eyebrow-dark">
                    You are not alone
                </p>

                <h2>
                    Every health journey begins somewhere.
                </h2>
            </div>

            <div class="gw-health-welcome-copy">
                <p class="gw-health-opening">
                    Looking for better health does not mean you have failed.
                    It means you are paying attention.
                </p>

                <p>
                    You may be searching for more energy, better daily habits,
                    clearer information, or simply a practical place to begin.
                </p>

                <p>
                    My goal is not to convince you that I have every answer.
                    My goal is to help you understand the options I discovered,
                    answer your questions honestly, and give you room to decide
                    what feels right for you.
                </p>

                <div class="gw-health-note">
                    <p>
                        Take your time. Better decisions begin with better
                        understanding.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


<section class="gw-health-story">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="gw-health-story-grid">
            <div class="gw-health-story-copy">
                <p class="gw-eyebrow gw-eyebrow-dark">
                    Why this matters to me
                </p>

                <h2>
                    I know what it feels like to search for answers.
                </h2>

                <p>
                    My own health journey began many years ago. After major
                    abdominal surgery when I was seventeen, I lived with
                    digestive challenges that affected everyday life.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Over the years, I tried to understand my body, improve my
                    habits, and learn what might help me feel better.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Eventually, I discovered wellness products that made a
                    meaningful difference in my personal experience. That
                    experience made me curious—not only about the products,
                    but about the science and education behind them.
                </p>

                <p class="gw-health-story-caution">
                    My experience is personal and is not a promise of what
                    anyone else will experience. Every person and every health
                    journey is different.
                </p>
            </div>

            <aside class="gw-health-story-quote">
                <span class="gw-health-story-mark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>

                <blockquote>
                    “I do not expect my experience to become your experience.
                    I simply believe you deserve honest information before
                    making your own decision.”
                </blockquote>

                <p>— Michael Grover</p>
            </aside>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


<section class="gw-health-beliefs">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="gw-section-heading">
            <p class="gw-eyebrow gw-eyebrow-dark">
                What you can expect here
            </p>

            <h2>
                A healthier conversation begins with trust.
            </h2>

            <p class="gw-section-intro">
                These principles guide every health conversation at
                Grover Wellness.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="gw-health-belief-grid">
            <article class="gw-health-belief-card">
                <span class="gw-health-belief-number" aria-hidden="true">
                    01
                </span>

                <h3>Education before recommendation.</h3>

                <p>
                    I want you to understand what you are considering and why
                    it may—or may not—fit your goals.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="gw-health-belief-card">
                <span class="gw-health-belief-number" aria-hidden="true">
                    02
                </span>

                <h3>Respect before pressure.</h3>

                <p>
                    You will always have room to ask questions, think, and
                    decide in your own time.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="gw-health-belief-card">
                <span class="gw-health-belief-number" aria-hidden="true">
                    03
                </span>

                <h3>Progress before perfection.</h3>

                <p>
                    Meaningful change often begins with one informed,
                    manageable step.
                </p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


<section class="gw-health-learning">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="gw-health-learning-panel">
            <div>
                <p class="gw-eyebrow">
                    Let’s understand the why
                </p>

                <h2>
                    I have spent my life learning how things work.
                </h2>
            </div>

            <div>
                <p>
                    Whether I was working with electronics, machinery,
                    software, engines, or strength training, I always wanted
                    to understand the system—not simply accept the result.
                </p>

                <p>
                    I approach wellness the same way. Before recommending
                    anything, I believe we should ask thoughtful questions,
                    examine the available information, and understand what
                    role a product may play.
                </p>

                <p class="gw-health-learning-emphasis">
                    Knowledge creates confidence. Confidence helps you make a
                    decision that belongs to you.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


<section class="gw-health-discovery">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="gw-health-discovery-grid">
            <div class="gw-health-discovery-heading">
                <p class="gw-eyebrow gw-eyebrow-dark">
                    What I discovered
                </p>

                <h2>
                    Why I chose to explore Zinzino.
                </h2>
            </div>

            <div class="gw-health-discovery-copy">
                <p>
                    What first interested me was not a sales message. It was
                    the emphasis on education, testing, nutrition, and helping
                    people better understand their own choices.
                </p>

                <p>
                    I continued learning because I wanted to understand what
                    made the approach different and whether it aligned with
                    my own values.
                </p>

                <p>
                    I am still learning, and I will always encourage you to
                    review the information, ask questions, and decide for
                    yourself.
                </p>

                <a class="gw-text-link" href="#health-next-step">
                    See where you can go next
                    <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


<section id="health-next-step" class="gw-health-next-step">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="gw-health-next-panel">
            <p class="gw-eyebrow">
                Your next step
            </p>

            <h2>
                What would help you feel more confident?
            </h2>

            <p class="gw-health-next-intro">
                There is no single correct next step. Choose the one that
                matches what you need today.
            </p>

            <div class="gw-health-next-grid">
                <a class="gw-health-next-choice" href="#">
                    <span>01</span>

                    <strong>
                        I would like to understand the wellness approach.
                    </strong>

                    <small>Learn before deciding →</small>
                </a>

                <a class="gw-health-next-choice" href="#">
                    <span>02</span>

                    <strong>
                        I would like to explore the products.
                    </strong>

                    <small>See what is available →</small>
                </a>

                <a class="gw-health-next-choice" href="#contact">
                    <span>03</span>

                    <strong>
                        I have a question for Michael.
                    </strong>

                    <small>Begin a conversation →</small>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


<section class="gw-health-sunrise-thought">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="gw-health-sunrise-content">
            <span aria-hidden="true">✦</span>

            <blockquote>
                Small, consistent steps can lead to extraordinary change.
            </blockquote>

            <p>
                Thank you for sharing part of your health journey with me.
            </p>

            <a class="gw-text-link" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">
                Return to the crossroads
                <span aria-hidden="true">←</span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


<section class="gw-health-disclaimer">
    <div class="container">
        <p>
            The information on this page is provided for general educational
            purposes and reflects personal experience. It is not medical advice
            and is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent disease.
            Speak with a qualified healthcare professional regarding your
            individual health needs.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>